# Credentials for integration/full-profile eval cases (TKAI-336).
# Copy to .env.eval and fill in DEDICATED eval credentials.
#
# Rules:
# 1. Never reuse production credentials. The eval runner rejects known
#    production variables (DATABASE_URL, POSTGRES_URL, ...) outright.
# 2. `integration` cases run read-only (riskLevel "low") actions.
# 3. `full` cases can mutate. Point their credentials at throwaway
#    resources (a test repo, a test workspace).
#
# Env var -> credential service mapping lives in
# packages/eval/src/integration.ts (ENV_CREDENTIAL_MAP).

# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
# LINEAR_API_KEY=lin_api_...
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-...
# NOTION_API_KEY=ntn_...
